meta {
  name: Reset Password with Token
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "token": "rst_tok_sample_123",
    "newPassword": "NewSecurePassword123!"
  }
}

docs {
  # Reset Password with Token
  Set a new password using the token received in the forgot-password email.

  ### Authentication
  Reset Token

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Guest

  ### Request Body Fields
  - `token` (string, required) - Reset token from verification email.
  - `newPassword` (string, required) - New password satisfying complexity requirements.

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `200` - Password successfully updated.
  - `400` - Invalid or expired reset token.
  - `500` - Internal server error.

  ### Response Example (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Password reset completed successfully. You may now sign in."
  }
  ```
}
